ue,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":1,"text":"Varzi pits, cut by glass from his shattered windscreen; reserve driver Pietsch takes over.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":2,"text":"Stuck completed the second lap in 6m13s, 12 seconds ahead of Fagioli who had overtaken Rosemeyer, a further two seconds back","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":2,"text":"Siena, one of the Maserati drivers, retired prematurely on the second lap with a broken suspension spring.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":13},{"lap":3,"text":"Rosemeyer pits for a makeshift metal windscreen and a new plug, dropping to eighth; Stuck leads Fagioli by 15 seconds.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":5,"text":"Stuck in first place had an advantage of 13 seconds to Fagioli, 17s to Caracciola and 35s to Wimille.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":6,"text":"Stuck laps in 6m11s and leads Fagioli by 12 seconds; Rosemeyer passes Nuvolari for seventh.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":7,"text":"Pietsch pits; Varzi takes his car back with a makeshift metal windscreen.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":8,"text":"Brauchitsch passes Chiron for fifth; Nuvolari comes slowly into his pit and retires.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":8,"text":"Nuvolari comes slowly into his pit and retires.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":9,"text":"On lap nine, Caracciola drove a lap in 6m9.3s and passed Fagioli, and who then followed him like a shadow.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":10,"text":"Varzi, a lap down, laps in 5m58.6s; Stuck leads Caracciola by 12 seconds.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":12,"text":"Wimille in fourth place was 2m19s ahead of Brauchitsch, 2m46s of Chiron, 3m13s of Rosemeyer, and 6m33s of Varzi, who had already been lapped","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":13,"text":"The big turning-point took place on lap 13, when Stuck pulled into his pit and Caracciola's Mercedes moved into the lead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":14,"text":"Stuck returns to the pits and retires with a slipping clutch.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":15,"text":"Varzi hands back to Pietsch and refuels; the gears are jumping out.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":16,"text":"Caracciola refuels and Fagioli leads; Brauchitsch's left rear tire throws a thread at over 230 km/h in front of the grandstand.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":16,"text":"On lap 16 Brauchitsch's left rear tire had thrown a thread while doing over 230 km/h and gave him trouble trying to keep the car on the road.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":17,"text":"Fagioli stops for tires and fuel; Caracciola leads again.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":20,"text":"After 20 laps Caracciola led by 1m12s ahead of Fagioli followed by Wimille, Brauchitsch, Chiron, Rosemeyer and the rest","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":21,"text":"Brauchitsch passes Wimille: three Mercedes in front.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":25,"text":"Fagioli cuts Caracciola's lead to 45 seconds.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":27,"text":"came to a stop on lap 27 when the transmission broke at km 6 on the straight past Andoain.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":28,"text":"Chiron retires at his pit with a cracked crankcase; Rosemeyer up to fifth.","q":false,"c":7},{"lap":30,"text":"Lehoux and L\u00e9oz both retire on the last lap.","q":false,"c":8},{"lap":30,"text":"After 30 laps Caracciola finished 43 seconds ahead of Fagioli, followed by Brauchitsch in third position. Wimille finished an impressive fourth in his Bugatti","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0}]}